      "body": "Adds `blog/src/content/posts/x402-on-moi.md`: how the x402 `exact` scheme works on MOI, why it settles first and proves second, the eight facilitator rules, and the seller and buyer code samples.\n\n**Do not merge yet.** The post describes three upstream contributions (the CASA `moi` namespace, the scheme spec, the `@x402/moi` package) that are still in internal review. Before merging:\n\n- [ ] Rahul's review\n- [ ] The three upstream PRs are open; update the \"What did we build\" section with links\n- [ ] Set `date` to the publish date (placeholder `2026-09-12`)\n\nChecks run: blog build (zod) and root build both pass and the apex listing card renders; no em dashes, HTML comments or curly quotes; code samples checked against `@x402/core` 2.25.0, `@x402/hono` and `@x402/fetch` 2.25.0 type definitions; ecosystem figures from x402.org on 10 September 2026, Stripe MPP from stripe.com.\n\nPreview once the workflow runs: `https://pr-<N>-blog.preview.moi.technology/article/x402-on-moi/`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
