      "body": "`agentpay-mcp` v4.1.17 exposes `x402_pay` as a real 402 → policy check → sign → retry loop against an arbitrary HTTP URL, including POST with a JSON body. The README's MCP example uses `CHAIN_ID=84532` (Base Sepolia); the tool also documents Base mainnet (`8453`).\n\nI work on zFinia (https://zfinia.com). We already serve exact x402 on Base USDC. This is not a request to add zFinia to a catalog, endorse the product, or buy anything.\n\nIf you want a cheap independent **Base mainnet** regression target for `x402_pay` (HTTP, not MCP-session), this existing route is live:\n\n- `POST https://api.zfinia.com/x402/v1/accessibility-contrast-calculator`\n- Network `eip155:8453`, scheme `exact`, amount `1000` atomic USDC (`$0.001`)\n- Unpaid POST returns HTTP 402 with a `PAYMENT-REQUIRED` header (x402 v2 accepts[])\n- Catalog: https://api.zfinia.com/.well-known/x402.json\n\n`x402_pay` input that matches the live 402:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://api.zfinia.com/x402/v1/accessibility-contrast-calculator\",\n  \"method\": \"POST\",\n  \"headers\": { \"content-type\": \"application/json\" },\n  \"body\": \"{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#000000\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#ffffff\\\",\\\"large_text\\\":false}\"\n}\n```\n\nWallet config for this host is Base mainnet (`CHAIN_ID=8453`), not the Sepolia example in the README. After independent buyer settlement and retry, the paid JSON includes `contrast_ratio: 21`.\n\nzFinia MCP at https://api.zfinia.com/mcp is challenge-handoff only. It will not sign or pay on the caller's behalf, so it is not a fixture for a paid MCP-session tool.\n\nIf you already have a preferred mainnet demo host, ignore this. Reply here or to support@zfinia.com if the 402 terms are incompatible with `x402_pay` (header name, POST body, exact amount, or mainnet-only accept).",
